Runtime Revolution announces Revolution 1.1.1

*New Features
*New lower Pricing of students and small business 
*New enterprise level package

Runtime Revolution is pleased to announce the release of Revolution
1.1.1, the award nominated cross-platform development tool. The new
release contains a range of feature enhancements such as improved
database access, new driver support allowing access to any device and
improvements in stability and compatibility.

Revolution is a fully featured cross-platform tool which allows
developers to write their code once and build executables for Linux,
Unix, Mac OS (including OS X) and Windows.

Runtime is also pleased to announce new editions for students ($99)
and small business ($299) as well as an enterprise level package. The
enterprise level package includes the ability for customers to tailor
the support and training options to their exact needs.

Revolution combines an advanced feature set with an easy to use
development environment and powerful programming language. Revolution
includes a whole range of features including:

*Database access to ODBC, MySQL, Oracle and Valentina.
*Full support for multimedia including QuickTime.
*CGI Processing.
*The ability to access external libraries.
*Support for a range of internet protocols.
*Advanced regular expression handling.
*A range of managers taking care of aspects such as animation and
databases.
*The ability to create graphical or command line based applications.

A free download of Revolution and further information is available
from:

http://www.runrev.com

For specific enquries please email: info@runrev.com

Revolution
The Solution for Software Development
In Enterprise, Business and Education.

